      "text": "Audit rows: allow-by-classifier (judge ALLOW, or the no-judge shortcut) and deny-by-classifier (rules block under auto, or judge BLOCK), each carrying stage, outcome, tag, latency and judge model.\nAn auto allow still passes the PreToolUse hook before the tool runs.",
